{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is approached, take it, check properties; move and take action. Else find object.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = TakeAction    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
